  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since vector&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are coplanar then,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math><br />From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>"
  }
